# auth0/ (Terraform, specs/012 research R17): local state and plans can hold tenant data, and tfvars name the tenant
# and the approver: the pipeline takes those from its GitHub environment's variables, never from a file. The
# provider lock file (.terraform.lock.hcl) is committed.
